# Used by docker/otel-js-init-container/Dockerfile, which COPYs the whole
# repo (build context = repo root) into its sdk-build stage. Keep this list
# to things that are safely regenerated inside the image, so the image
# always builds from source rather than stale host artifacts.
.git
**/.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/build
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
*.log
npm-debug.log*
